# Pinned desktop build tools, installed with desktop/scripts/tools.sh into
# ../bin. Each line: package, version, and the Go module checksum (h1:, a
# SHA-256 hash of the module's source) that `go version -m` must report
# for the installed binary. `go install` checks the source against the
# checksum database; the script then checks the binary against this file.
